# On the install medium (its package pool, not the live system): the boot
# loader for UEFI PCs, Debian's signed one (shim) so Secure Boot works,
# which the installer puts into the new system, so it works without
# internet. A list of its own: it can't be installed together with the
# BIOS one.
grub-efi
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
efibootmgr
